{"detail": {"templateUuid": "e80774cc27f1449da0acee282ae36de4", "projectUuid": "c9cfb6f19caa4b019cb5f6f96752eec9", "name": "168", "description": "2月28日，伊朗南部米纳布市的沙贾雷·塔耶贝女子小学在授课期间遭袭，造成168名女童遇难。\n168个孩子没能走出废墟，\n他们化成黑色煤球，\n守护着唯一幸存的孩子。\n\n在他的眼里，\n飞机变成巨鹰，\n导弹变成鹰蛋，\n士兵变成胡萝卜怪物。\n\n这不是童话，\n而是战争留给孩子的噩梦。", "coverUrl": "/assets/05bbc1c4bcf55f8b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/6b3481a0fabd49d4aa3690470287e8d3/3d5ae0fb9065668919025c24b0510ba987aef92a.mp4", "snapshotId": 9518, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1678837, "ownerUuid": "6b3481a0fabd49d4aa3690470287e8d3", "avatar": "/assets/7597abccd5cbd7d5.webp", "nickname": "巧", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 101, "tags": [{"id": 3031, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "大乱斗｜vol.1 显形记", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3031/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3032, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "1-纪实与观察", "parentTag": 3031, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3031/3032", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "11 【每一帧都是艺术！定格动画《168》初体验 - 阿巧 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 cMY7EWfKjs9150j 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/69fb96bd0000000036031058?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABHgRrB05IVU9CXpLjHsy9CiPzkundUd0pKBYgEe2VMlE=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年05月07日 03:33", "updateAt": "2026年06月05日 21:04", "publishAt": "2026年05月07日 03:33", "honors": ["最佳显形"], "awardedTag": ["最佳显形"], "playCount": 25, "viewCreationProcessCount": 5, "copyCanvasCount": 2, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/e80774cc2